WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.222
Lesson two. At the Park!

2
00:00:04.159 --> 00:00:10.925
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:13.518
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:16.729
Today we learn: At the Park! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:21.770
Slide! Say it with me. Slide!

6
00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:29.003
Swing! Say it with me. Swing!

7
00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:36.430
Tree! Say it with me. Tree!

8
00:00:40.464 --> 00:00:44.098
Grass! Say it with me. Grass!

9
00:00:48.141 --> 00:00:51.441
Bench! Say it with me. Bench!

10
00:00:55.397 --> 00:00:58.847
Path! Say it with me. Path!

11
00:01:02.819 --> 00:01:06.102
Pond! Say it with me. Pond!

12
00:01:10.131 --> 00:01:13.481
Ball! Say it with me. Ball!

13
00:01:17.508 --> 00:01:23.932
Listen. There is a swing. There are two trees.

14
00:01:23.982 --> 00:01:28.769
Say it with me. There is a swing. There are two trees.

15
00:01:33.546 --> 00:01:38.946
Children play happily on the swings at the green park. We sit on a bench near the pond.

16
00:01:38.996 --> 00:01:40.242
I like this story!

17
00:01:41.249 --> 00:01:46.340
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:47.500
Tree!

19
00:01:48.256 --> 00:01:53.504
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:53.554 --> 00:01:54.704
Path!

21
00:01:55.612 --> 00:02:00.976
Value corner: Sharing. Sharing our things with friends makes everyone happier.

22
00:02:01.026 --> 00:02:02.600
I can show sharing too!

23
00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:10.640
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.166
Bye-bye, friends!

